				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 742530101,
					"content": "To be honest, I'm still in shock.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530102,
					"content": "You know, back then, both Alain and I thought you'd already left this world.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530103,
					"content": "Hmm... If we had woken up earlier, maybe we could have visited you and Alain. But, I suppose that's fate.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530104,
					"content": "Ms. Mary-Ann...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530105,
					"content": "Fate works in mysterious ways. Who would have thought that Ann and I would see a film poster featuring your portrait during our travels?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530106,
					"content": "So that's what made you think to contact me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530107,
					"content": "Precisely!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530108,
					"content": "Ah... The aroma of coffee. It really takes me back... Hehe, thank you for inviting us to your tea party, Miss Sandrone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530109,
					"content": "Your garden is so elegantly arranged. It's perfect for a lady of such grace.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530110,
					"content": "This is the home Alain and I once shared. I feel it's only right that I maintain its beauty.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530111,
					"content": "See? You're already so much better at this than my brother.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530112,
					"content": "Alain never even decorated his room. He couldn't deal with pretty things.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530113,
					"content": "That's right, and Rene was no different. Jakob and I were the only ones who could properly spruce up a room — and prepare a tea party.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530114,
					"content": "So he was like that even when he was little? I always thought it was due to his age...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530115,
					"content": "He was always that way. He may have been book smart, but he was a bit of a klutz in other ways.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530116,
					"content": "Maybe that's why he was the only one of us who chose painful reality over the illusion of a sweet dream.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530117,
					"content": "Huh. I don't think he regretted that choice.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530118,
					"content": "No, because that was his wish as a hero.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530119,
					"content": "The regret is ours. His wish should never have stood alone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530120,
					"content": "What about you, Miss Sandrone? Is there something you wish for?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530121,
					"content": "Alain once asked me that exact same question.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530122,
					"content": "Hmm? So he asked you that, too?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530123,
					"content": "My brother must have matured a lot. He never would have asked something like that when I knew him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530124,
					"content": "\"Wish\" is such a hollow word. Can you ever have whatever you want? Hah, if that were the case, there would be no bad in the world.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530125,
					"content": "I'm doing what I want to do, what I believe to be right. I don't know if this counts as a wish, but it makes me happy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530126,
					"content": "Hmm, now that is a wonderful thing. I envy you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530127,
					"content": "Then do you... resent Alain? Because he created you... in Mary-Ann's image.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530128,
					"content": "Never. He always made it clear that I'm my own person — unique and distinct — and that I should choose my own life. So that's exactly what I did.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530129,
					"content": "Haha, whether it's stories or food, as long as you're happy with your choices, then they're the right choices for you, Sandrone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742530130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ann"
				},
				{
					"id": 742530130,
					"content": "Exactly. So now, let's just quietly enjoy the food you've so carefully prepared for us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Mary-Ann"
				}
			]
		},
